        "story_eyebrow": "Our Story",
        "story_heading": "Designed in Sweden Since 1985",
        "story_text": "<p>Teng Tools was founded in 1985 by Henri Tengvall, who saw that mechanics needed more than just quality hand tools — they needed a way to keep them organised. The company name blends the founder's surname with the Japanese Tengu, a mythical figure symbolising strength, courage and innovative thinking.</p><p>Every tool is designed around our TC Tray system: modular trays that click together into any storage solution, so every tool has its place and nothing gets lost. Independent testing has ranked Teng Tools first or second across eight product categories — which is why every tool carries a lifetime warranty.</p>",
